{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"702620138662527047","content":"\"Oh hello spider person! I'm going to jump down this hole now after my other friend!\" Ozgur follows","created_at":"2020-07-21T04:47:44.161000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"734995002576338956","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"702620138662527047","content":"The door opens up to allow you all to barrel down. Inside is a smaller square room with wall paintings and carvings covering it completely. A glowing orange piece of crystal seems affixed inside the ceiling 15ft up providing bright warm light. The paintings on the wall seem to tell a story.\nTaking a minute you wipe away layers of dust to see a small group of hunched over humans seemingly casting a spell. Their figures are surrounded by a great wickedness with two, glowing red, pupil-less eyes clenched in a dark expression. The painting continues with the shadow of darkness manifesting itself inside a silhouetted being making its way to the top of a serene mountain where 15 pillars, each with a symbol of a god on them, stand in opposition. The scene beside it shows a clash of heroic looking figures fighting black tendrils. The same 15 symbols appear on the weapons, shields, or armor of the defending carved paintings. One of the markings shows a golden ray towards the monstrosity that seems to affect it in some way.\n\nThe wall next to it shows a massive creature under the sea consuming schools of fish and other beings.","created_at":"2020-07-21T04:47:49.596000Z","edited_at":"2020-07-21T04:51:27.632000Z","id":"734995025372643400","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[{"content_type":null,"filename":"https_lh4.googleusercontent.comftUepVcf6_hCrDbdNS7kuhWTEW9dwnmCSijT6Tj1CHyXe4RKUff4LmSbu7bcfwO22zjWA.png","id":"734995041617051698","local_path":"discord/roanoke-season-3/attachments/702620138662527047/734995041617051698-https_lh4.googleusercontent.comftUepVcf6_hCrDbdNS7kuhWTEW9dwnmCSijT6Tj1CHyXe4RKUff4LmSbu7bcfwO22zjWA.png","message_id":"734995041994670110","sha256":"f885cadb7f9fe545d89befab1bad531175ef27c1e1b20851190548f3678f8b98","size":904423,"url":"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/702620138662527047/734995041617051698/https_lh4.googleusercontent.comftUepVcf6_hCrDbdNS7kuhWTEW9dwnmCSijT6Tj1CHyXe4RKUff4LmSbu7bcfwO22zjWA.png?ex=6abfe039&is=6abe8eb9&hm=56062c242feb56cf0eb9c8e4844ef8728cef55ebeb0372107e4f9201dec0e9c8&"}],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"702620138662527047","content":"","created_at":"2020-07-21T04:47:53.559000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"734995041994670110","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"702620138662527047","content":"The scene continues with the heroes following the seamonster into a deep ocean city where they fight decrepit, twisted, humanoid creatures in front of the monstrosity. A few of the personified gods lay wounded beside the declining group of warriors. The leviathan seems to consume the bodies of the dead as it gains power.\n\n\nThe final wall shows a crowned hero bursting into some sort of light directed at the monster until a scene shows a decimated crater with ruins around it. The Crown lies in the ground depicted as a forgotten treasure standing as a testament to time.","created_at":"2020-07-21T04:48:12.862000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"734995122957320202","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
